    {
      "index": 2,
      "type": "question",
      "text": "LLM RouterのClassifierを専用モデルへ替えるとき、何を評価しますか。",
      "audio": "interview-question-02.mp3",
      "audioHash": "9c4a4cb5603d5074a9866bbb445c65fb3c65118094edc0ebc346bcfe32864fb5",
